## 5. API Service Layer

The `src/api/` folder will mirror the backend `routes/` structure:

- `auth.service.js` $\rightarrow$ `/auth/*`
- `item.service.js` $\rightarrow$ `/items/*` & `/categories/*`
- `claim.service.js` $\rightarrow$ `/claims/*` & `/items/{id}/claims`
- `admin.service.js` $\rightarrow$ `/admin/*`

**Example Pattern**:
```javascript
// item.service.js
export const ItemService = {
  getItems: (params) => axiosInstance.get('/items', { params }),
  getItem: (id) => axiosInstance.get(`/items/${id}`),
  createItem: (data) => axiosInstance.post('/items', data),
  updateItem: (id, data) => axiosInstance.patch(`/items/${id}`, data),
  closeItem: (id) => axiosInstance.patch(`/items/${id}/close`),
};
```

