## 6. Component Breakdown

### Reusable UI Components
- `ItemCard`: Displays title, type (Lost/Found), status badge, category, and location.
- `StatusBadge`: Color-coded badge based on `item_status` or `claim_status`.
- `ProtectedRoute`: Higher-order component to restrict access based on authentication and `user_role`.
- `Pagination`: Component to handle `page` and `page_size` updates.
- `FormField`: Wrapper for labels, inputs, and Zod error messages.

